{"school":{"dbn":"06M210","name":"P.S./I.S. 210 - Twenty-first Century Academy for Community Leadership","boro":"Manhattan","district":"06","district_label":"District 6","report_type":"EMS","report_types":"EMS","school_type":"K-8","grades":"K to 8","status":"open","enrollment":399,"enrollment_year":"2024-25","address":"501-503 WEST 152 STREET, MANHATTAN, NY 10031","phone":"929-506-2695","website":"HTTPS://WWW.PS210.ORG/ABOUT_US","directory_url":"https://www.myschools.nyc/en/schools/middle-school/70098","accessibility":"Fully Accessible","overview":"Our school is a PreK to 8th grade Dual Language (Spanish & English) that offers a warm and nurturing environment with a focus on hands-on learning.  Our students benefit from our commitment to music, fine arts, theater and sports. Parents appreciate that our staff is very personable and respectful in the way they treat both parents and students.  Our teachers are hardworking and knowledgeable about how students learn. Parents also enjoy participating in fun activities for themselves such as the Parent book club, cooking club, and jewelry-making club.  We also provide dynamic workshops to help parents assess their children's progress as well as to learn strategies for helping their children at home.   As a school we also have many partnerships and collaborations with different organizations.  We work with different programs and CBOs that offer afterschool program for our students that focuses on sports, homework help, art and Horticulture. We have licensed Art teachers that work with the students in theater, dance, music, and fine arts.   We also have a gym, Science Lab and a beautiful library.  Through a CASA grant our student get to grow some of their own herbs and vegetables in our roof top garden.","start_time":"8:15am","end_time":"2:35pm","languages":"Spanish","subway":"1 to 157th St; A, B, D to 145th St; C to 155th St","bus":"Bx19, Bx6, Bx6-SBS, M10, M100, M101, M11, M2, M3, M4, M5","shared_building":"1","neighborhoo